<div autocomplete="off" class="content" spellcheck="false">
				<p>
					The Salvation Army is led by officers – ordained ministers – who supervise the many programs and services provided in your area. They also serve as administrators, counselors, and youth leaders.
				</p>

				<p>
					Major Chris and Sandy Flanagan have been appointed as Area Commanders respectively for The Salvation Army of Hampton Roads.
				</p>

				<p>
					Their calling and passion for serving others come from their love and passion for serving Christ. 
				</p>

				<p>
					They are supported by numerous officers, dedicated staff, and board members.
				</p>
